{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792555620, "covers_from": "2026-10-21T04:07:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-21T04:08:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792555680, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-21T04:07:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 68455, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北市公園的噴水池常沒噴，每次帶小孩去都很失望，希望各公園的噴水池可以公告噴水時間，並且按照時間噴水", "display_name": "士林代表 No.68,455", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T04:07:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 68456, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北的夜景具有世界級的潛力，可惜沒有專業的設計，象山或微風平台如果有觀光纜車一定可以打響夜景知名度", "display_name": "信義代表 jasonccp", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T04:07:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40321, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "我其實不是很懂國家警報差別，地震也有、豪雨也有、測試也有，只知道每次聽到都心臟漏拍，希望能加強宣導", "display_name": "大安代表 No.40,321", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T04:07:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49603, "sprite_key": "giraffe_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "其他", "content": "我想找回當台北市民的光榮感，乾淨的城市，福利政策的領先，像當年的陳水扁市長能讓台北市民很驕傲", "display_name": "萬華代表 美萱", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 68456, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "display_name": "信義代表 jasonccp", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 40321, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.40,321", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 49603, "sprite_key": "giraffe_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 美萱", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 63513, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.63,513", "district": "wenshan",